   "options": "<div class=\"terms-conditions\">\n<h4>Terms and Conditions</h4>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Open Source Publication:</strong> By submitting this localization, you agree that your work will be made publicly available under an open source license.</li>\n<li><strong>Code Repository:</strong> The source code will be published on GitHub or similar platform for community access and contributions.</li>\n<li><strong>Documentation:</strong> You agree to provide comprehensive documentation for your localization.</li>\n<li><strong>Quality Standards:</strong> The localization must meet Frappe's quality and coding standards before publication.</li>\n<li><strong>Maintenance:</strong> You commit to maintaining the localization for compatibility with future ERPNext versions.</li>\n<li><strong>Attribution:</strong> Proper attribution will be given to you as the developer/contributor.</li>\n<li><strong>Community License:</strong> The localization will be available to the community under MIT or GPL license.</li>\n<li><strong>Frappe Cloud Integration:</strong> You agree to allow integration with Frappe Cloud marketplace if approved.</li>\n<li><strong>Government Compliance:</strong> You ensure the localization complies with local laws and regulations.</li>\n<li><strong>No Warranty:</strong> The localization is provided 'as-is' without warranty of any kind.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>",
